  "releaseNotes": "Features: implement GitHub discussions based script gallery with reactions, comments etc (#318) add PowerShell version switching between 5.1 and pwsh (#332) add EnableDuplicateDetection switch to Set-DataverseRecord (#331) implement file column cmdlets for Dataverse (Get/Set/Remove-DataverseFileData) (#322) add Invoke-DataverseXrmToolbox cmdlet to load XTB tools with the current connection. (#316) Bug Fixes: correct element ordering for Titles/Descriptions in all entry types (#325) deduplicate records in Get-DataverseSitemap and Get-DataverseAppModule when querying unpublished data (#326) Other Changes: update dependency microsoft.web.webview2 to 1.0.3650.58 (#333) update dependency mimetypesmap to 1.0.9 (#341) update dotnet monorepo (#296) update dependency nuget.protocol to 6.14.0 (#317) ensure stable property sort order to reduce noisy diffs in cmdlets docs (#329) Simplify README for Dataverse connection usage",
